      "en": [
        {
          "spans": [
            {
              "text": "עַל כֵּן נְקַוֶּה לְךָ—Therefore, we hope that soon we will see Your power and glory when You destroy all of society's false gods, and all of humanity will recognize Your Presence, and all the wicked will submit to You and accept the yoke of Your kingdom; and You will rule over the whole world; soon and forever!"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "spans": [
            {
              "text": "—As the pasuk says: \"Then Hashem will be the King over the entire earth; on that day Hashem will be One (everyone will realize there is no other power but Hashem), and His Name will be One (everyone will realize that all that has happened since Creation is all good, and all came from Hashem as part of one unified plan).\""
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "spans": [
            {
              "text": "—The person saying Kaddish proclaims our hope that) soon, in our lifetime, the entire world, which Hashem created precisely according to His Will, will recognize Hashem as the Source of all and will see the sanctity, perfection, and purpose of all He has done."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "spans": [
            {
              "text": "אָמֵן. יְהֵא שְׁמֵהּ רַבָּא מְבָרַךְ לְעָלַם וּלְעָלְמֵי עָלְמַיָּא—(We all enthusiastically respond:) Absolutely correct! May everyone (including me!), everywhere, and forever, see that all His actions are great and deserving of praise!"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "spans": [
            {
              "text": "—(The person saying Kaddish then points out that) in reality, the true greatness and power of Hashem far exceeds any praises that we mere humans could say. And to that we respond: אָמֵן—Absolutely correct!"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "spans": [
            {
              "text": "—(The person saying Kaddish requests:) May there be abundant peace that comes from Heaven, and life, upon us and upon all of Bnei Yisrael! And to that we respond: אָמֵן—Absolutely, we agree!"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "spans": [
            {
              "text": "—(The person saying Kaddish requests:) May He Who makes peace in the Heavens bring about peace upon us and upon all of Bnei Yisrael! And to that we respond: אָמֵן—Absolutely, we agree!"
            }
          ]
        }
      ],
